'''Li'l Cats''' are [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Lucky Capsule]]. They are based on the nine [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] obtained at the start of the game, but unlike the [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed Cats]], Li'l Cats are far weaker than their Normal counterparts, giving them very little use outside of [[Restriction Stage]]s that don't allow Normal and [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare]] units.

Similar to the Crazed Cats, Li'l Cats' [[True Form]]s are unlocked by clearing their own [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening Stages]], called [[:Category:Li'l Stages|Li'l Stages]]. They are unlocked after beating [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1. Each [[:Category:Li'l Stages|Li'l Stage]] appears the day before the corresponding Crazed Stage: for example, [[Tiny Meows (Deadly)|Li'l Cat Awakens!]] appears on the 2nd of every month, the day before [[Dark Souls (Insane)|The Crazed Cat]] and [[Deathhawk (Deadly)|Cat Maniac]]. The Li'l [[True Form]]s' stats range from moderately weaker to exactly the same as those of their Normal counterparts, but they still become outclassed by the Normal and Crazed Cats. However, most of them gain unique perks which can give them an edge over the Normal/Crazed equivalents in some scenarios, and can all further diverge via [[Talents]].
*[[Li'l Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Mohawk Cat]] is the cheapest unit in the game, costing a mere 45¢ to deploy at a longer cooldown.
*[[Li'l Tank Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Eraser Cat]] is [[Immune to Freeze]].
*[[Li'l Axe Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Dark Cat]] is [[Strong Against|strong]] against [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] instead of [[:Category:Red Enemies|Reds]].
*[[Li'l Gross Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Macho Legs Cat]] can [[Barrier Breaker|break]] [[Barrier]]s and has a chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] enemies as opposed to being [[Strong Against|strong]] against them.
*[[Li'l Cow Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Lion Cat]] is [[Immune to Waves|immune]] to [[Wave Attack]]s.
*[[Li'l Bird Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Flying Cat]] is [[Strong Against|strong]] against and permanently [[Zombie Killer|kills]] [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemies instead of being able to [[Weaken|weaken]] [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies.
*[[Li'l Fish Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Island Cat]] has higher [[Critical Hit]] chance (5% > 2%).
*[[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]] has... the exact same stats as his Normal counterpart.
*[[Li'l Titan Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Jamiera Cat]] has a faster attack rate (57f <sup>1.9s</sup> > 67f <sup>2.23s</sup>).

